{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "aura_cadence",
  "spec": ["aura 5.1", "aura 6.4", "aura 17.14"],
  "description": "SimNewDay runs DoIdle(5) first, then returns false iff state != 0 and state < date - cycleStart (unsigned): cycle started on day 1000, on day 1005 state 3 becomes 4 (no departments) and 4 < 5 -> false; state 6 -> 7 -> true; state 0 -> true; SimNewMonth only restarts an idle pipeline (5 stays 5, 0 -> 1); SimIdle steps with data3 ms; a date before the start wraps to a large unsigned difference -> false. A full cycle with one lot is 17 calls (one per state 1..17; state 3 with no department and state 5 with one lot take one call each) with one history record and one 0x2A09B21A; with no lots the cycle ends at state 4 after taking the iterator, without history or post. Hand-derived.",
  "steps": [
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 1000, "lots": [{"rect": [0, 0, 0, 0], "pops": [[4112, 1]]}]},
    {"op": "aura_create"},
    {"op": "aura_init", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 2, "cycle_start_day": 1000}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 1005},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 3}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 4}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 6}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 7}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 4}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 5}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 0}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_env", "date": 990},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimIdle", "data3": 20, "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 2, "cycle_start_day": 990}},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 3, "cycle_start_day": 1000}},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewDay", "expect": false},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimBegin", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_run", "expect_calls": 17},
    {"op": "aura_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "history"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "aura_expect_event_count", "filter": {"event": "post", "type": "0x2A09B21A"}, "count": 1},
    {"op": "aura_env", "lots": null},
    {"op": "aura_set", "state": {"state": 1}},
    {"op": "aura_clear_events"},
    {"op": "aura_run", "expect_calls": 4},
    {"op": "aura_expect_events", "events": [{"event": "lot_iterator"}]},
    {"op": "aura_message", "type": "SimNewMonth", "expect": true},
    {"op": "aura_expect", "state": {"state": 1}}
  ]
}
